les CRM","txt.suite_trial.sales_crm_theme.task_one.paragraph":"Customer relationship management (CRM) tools help your sales reps and support agents collaborate on how to make the most of opportunities. By sharing key data and insights in a central place, everyone can work together easily, providing a seamless customer experience.","txt.suite_trial.sales_crm_theme.task_one.percentage":"{{number}}{{#styledSign}}%{{/styledSign}}","txt.suite_trial.sales_crm_theme.task_one.statistic_1":"Improvement in transparency across the business to drive revenue","txt.suite_trial.sales_crm_theme.task_one.statistic_2":"Increased collaboration between service and sales","txt.suite_trial.sales_crm_theme.task_one.statistic_3":"Faster sales followups and ticket resolutions","txt.suite_trial.sales_crm_theme.task_two.paragraph":"Your sales team juggles a lot of prospects while trying to close deals. Give them customer relationship management (CRM) software that makes it easy to do it all because it aligns processes, streamlines your pipeline, and automates tracking of activities.","txt.suite_trial.sales_crm_theme.task_two.action_button.text":"Set up your sales CRM","txt.suite_trial.lightbox.next":"Next","txt.suite_trial.lightbox.previous":"Previous","txt.suite_trial.lightbox.close":"Close","txt.support.add_user_modal.errors.name_is_blank":"Enter a name","txt.support.add_user_modal.errors.name_is_too_long":"Maximum 255 characters","txt.support.add_user_modal.errors.email_is_blank":"Enter an email","txt.support.add_user_modal.errors.email_is_badly_formatted":"Enter a valid email","txt.support.add_user_modal.errors.email_is_in_use":"Email is already in use","txt.support.add_user_modal.errors.email_is_too_long":"Maximum 255 characters","support.add_user_modal.errors.separation_invalid":"Only end users can be added to this brand.","txt.support.add_user_modal.header":"Add new user","txt.support.add_user_modal.add_button":"Add","support.add_user_modal.brand_dropdown.no_brand.label":"-","support.add_user_modal.brand_dropdown.no_brand.aria_label":"No brand","txt.support.agent_as_a_requester_modal.title":"Assign ticket to %{assignedGroupName}","txt.support.agent_as_a_requester_modal.body":"%{formattedGroupName} is a private group you don't belong to. As the requester, you'll view this ticket like a customer after it's submitted. Only %{groupName} members and followers will see messages.","txt.support.agent_as_a_requester_modal.body_v2":"%{formattedGroupName} is a private group you don't belong to. As the requester, you'll view this ticket in your email like a customer after it's submitted. Only %{groupName} members and followers will see messages.","txt.support.agent_as_a_requester_modal.body_v3":"%{formattedGroupName} is a group you don't belong to and don't have access to. As the requester, you'll view this ticket in your email like a customer after it's submitted. Only %{groupName} members and followers will see messages.","txt.ticket.next_ticket.button":"Next","txt.suite_trial.header.get_help":"Get help","txt.suite_trial.header_nav.back":"Back","txt.suite_trial.header_nav.next":"Next","txt.suite_trial.task_feedback.yes":"Yes","txt.suite_trial.task_feedback.no":"No","txt.suite_trial.task_feedback.question":"Did you find the content on this page helpful?","txt.try_buy_experience.dashboard_nav.chat_now_button":"Chat now","txt.support.views.suspended_modal.heading":"Suspended ticket #{{ticket_id}}","txt.support.views.suspended_modal.from":"From","txt.support.views.suspended_modal.to":"To","txt.support.views.suspended_modal.subject":"Subject","txt.support.views.suspended_modal.received_at":"Received","txt.support.views.suspended_modal.cause":"Cause","txt.support.views.suspended_modal.message_id":"Message ID","txt.support.views.suspended_modal.attachments":"Attachments","txt.support.views.suspended_modal.actions.auto_recover":"Recover automatically","txt.support.views.suspended_modal.actions.manual_recover":"Recover manually","txt.support.views.suspended_modal.a