Save commonly used responses and actions to resolve tickets faster","txt.ticket.footer.macro_wizard.paste_ingress.header":"Turn common responses into one-click macros","txt.ticket.footer.macro_wizard.paste_ingress.label":"No need to copy and paste every time. Create macros so all of your agents can solve common questions confidently and consistently in just one click.","txt.ticket.footer.macro_wizard.paste_ingress.maybe_later_button":"Maybe later","txt.ticket.footer.macro_wizard.paste_ingress.set_it_up_button":"Set it up","macro_simple_setup.tooltip_dialog.close_label":"Close tooltip","adopt.tcap.qa_prompt.header":"Easy way to quick assign","adopt.tcap.qa_prompt.header_v2":"Quick assign tickets","adopt.tcap.qa_prompt.description":"Triggers and automations can do the work of assignment for you.","adopt.tcap.qa_prompt.description_v2":"Reduce manual work, speed up responses, and establish clear ticket ownership by automatically assigning tickets to the first agent who replies.","adopt.tcap.qa_prompt.description_v3":"Speed up responses by auto-assigning tickets to the first agent who replies.","adopt.tcap.qa_prompt.close_button":"Close","adopt.tcap.qa_prompt.close_button_v2":"See more details","adopt.tcap.qa_prompt.activate_button":"Activate now","adopt.tcap.qa_prompt.confirmation.description":"You can always activate this later from settings.","adopt.macros.paste_submit_contextual_prompt.title":"Turn replies into one-click macros","adopt.macros.paste_submit_contextual_prompt.description":"No need to copy and paste every time. Create quick, consistent answers to common questions.","adopt.macros.paste_submit_contextual_prompt.primary_cta":"Review","adopt.tcap.bump_customer_prompt.title":"Stay on top of unanswered tickets","adopt.tcap.bump_customer_prompt.description":"Automatically notify requesters when there’s no reply on a ticket to reduce manual follow-up.","adopt.tcap.bump_customer_prompt.primary_cta":"Review","adopt.views.urgent_tickets_prompt.title":"Create an urgent tickets view","adopt.views.urgent_tickets_prompt.description":"Track urgent customer activity in one place by creating a shared view for urgent tickets.","adopt.views.urgent_tickets_prompt.primary_cta":"Create view","adopt.views.urgent_tickets_prompt.title_v2":"Keep urgent tickets front and center","adopt.views.urgent_tickets_prompt.description_v2":"Show urgent tickets in one view so they’re easier to see and prioritize.","adopt.views.urgent_tickets_prompt.primary_cta_v2":"Review","adopt.macros.waiting_on_internal_info_prompt.title":"Speed up internal reviews","adopt.macros.waiting_on_internal_info_prompt.description":"Create a macro that adds a note and sets tickets to pending when they need internal info.","adopt.macros.waiting_on_internal_info_prompt.primary_cta":"Review","adopt.macros.ai_contextual_prompt.title":"Automate repeat answers","adopt.macros.ai_contextual_prompt.description":"An AI agent can take over recurring questions and handle them automatically, every time.","adopt.macros.ai_contextual_prompt.primary_cta":"Create AI agent","adopt.help_center.ai_contextual_prompt.title":"Turn help content into instant answers","adopt.help_center.ai_contextual_prompt.description":"AI agents can use your help center to resolve similar questions before they reach your queue.","adopt.help_center.ai_contextual_prompt.primary_cta":"Get started","adopt.ticket_solved_quickly.ai_contextual_prompt.title":"Free your team from simple requests","adopt.ticket_solved_quickly.ai_contextual_prompt.description":"Requests like these add up. An AI agent can handle them automatically, around the clock.","adopt.ticket_solved_quickly.ai_contextual_prompt.primary_cta":"Get started","adopt.frt.ai_contextual_prompt.title":"Give customers faster first replies","adopt.frt.ai_contextual_prompt.description":"Response times climbing? An AI agent can handle common requests instantly and bring them back down.","adopt.frt.ai_contextual_prompt.primary_cta":"Create AI agent","adopt.bulk_actions.