eb-search.welcome.subtitle":"AI agents deliver quick, accurate answers to your customers, freeing up your support team.","txt.openai-web-search.welcome.secondary_header":"Add your website","txt.openai-web-search.welcome.secondary_subtitle":"We'll crawl the web to build knowledge for your AI agent.","txt.openai-web-search.welcome.secondary_subtitle_v2":"We'll use your info to build knowledge for your AI agent.","txt.openai-web-search.welcome.ai_link_content":"Powered by generative AI","txt.openai-web-search.welcome.ai_link":"https://support.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/6059285322522-Generative-AI-at-Zendesk","txt.openai-web-search.welcome.placeholder":"https://yourcompany.com","txt.openai-web-search.welcome.cta.get_started":"Get started","txt.openai-web-search.team.header":"Next, invite people to join the AI experience","txt.openai-web-search.team.subtitle":"Your team works hand-in-hand with AI to deliver fast, accurate, and personal service to customers. Invite them now.","txt.openai-web-search.add_knowledge.subtitle":"Here's some starter content we pulled to show how your AI agent answers questions. You'll be able to add more knowledge sources later, like your website or live agent tickets, to make it even smarter.","txt.openai-web-search.add_knowledge.loading":"Loading info about your company","txt.openai-web-search.add_knowledge.info.sucess_loaded":"Your AI agent is using this info to answer questions.","txt.openai-web-search.add_knowledge.info.sucess_updated":"Your AI agent has what it needs. Ask a question to see it in action.","txt.openai-web-search.add_knowledge.preview.tag":"Give your AI agent a try","txt.openai-web-search.ai_summary.check_item.add_your_knowledge":"Added content","txt.openai-web-search.ai_summary.check_item.add_team":"Added team","txt.openai-web-search.connect_email.other_email.description":"Other email providers connect in a different way. You'll see those steps later.","txt.openai-web-search.welcome.invalid_url":"Can't use this URL, try another.","txt.openai-web-search.welcome.empty_url":"Enter your URL to get started.","txt.openai-web-search.welcome.http_error":"URL must start with http or https.","txt.openai-web-search.welcome.local_url_error":"Local URLs not allowed, try another.","txt.openai-web-search.welcome.info_load_error":"Couldn't load info on your company.","txt.openai-web-search.add-knowledge.discard_changes":"Discard changes","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.header":"Automate support from day one","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.header-v2":"Let's make Zendesk yours","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.header-v3":"Let's get your Zendesk ready","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.description":"See how AI agents deliver quick, accurate answers to your customers, freeing up your support team.","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.description-v2":"Drop in your website and we'll start personalizing your trial.","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.description-v3":"Just add your website and we'll customize your trial with tickets and info that match what you do.","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.subtitle":"Give your AI agent the info it needs","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.subtitle-v2":"Website URL","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.input.description":"We'll use info from your website and the web to build knowledge for your AI agent. {{ai_link}}","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.ai_link_content":"Powered by AI","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.ai_link":"https://support.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/6059285322522-Generative-AI-at-Zendesk","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.add_content_btn":"Add content manually","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.add_content_btn_v2":"Or set up manually","accelerated_setup.retail_confirmation.heading":"Based on your website, your business is in retail. Does this look right?","accelerated_setup.retail_confirmation.description":"We’ll set you up with best-practice workflows for businesses in your industry.","accelerated_setup.retail_confirmation.confirm":"Yes, that’s correct","accelerated_setup.retail_confirmation.decline":"No, skip retail setup","accelerated_setup.retail_workflows.loader_item":"Setting up returns and refunds workflows","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome.error":"Something went wrong. Try adding content manually.","txt.single-page-crawl.loader.text":"Giving your AI agent some knowledge","txt.single-page-crawl.loader.subtext":"Looking through your website for some helpful info to feed your AI agent.","txt.single-page-crawl.loader.subtext_v2":"Looking for helpful content to feed your AI agent.","txt.single-page-crawl.loader.content-loaded.header":"Get ready to see your AI agent in action","txt.single-page-crawl.loader.content.header":"Setting up your Zendesk trial","txt.single-page-crawl.loader.content-loaded.description":"Your AI agent will use this content to answer questions.","txt.single-page-crawl.loader.content-loaded.openai_web_search_header":"Other info from the web","txt.single-page-crawl.loader.content-loaded.openai_web_search_header_v2":"Info from the web","txt.single-page-crawl.loader.list_item.support_channels":"Setting up support channels for your customers","txt.single-page-crawl.loader.list_item.url":"Finding the best content from {{url}}","txt.single-page-crawl.loader.list_sub_item.url_path":"crawled {{path}}","txt.single-page-crawl.loader.list_item.article":"Generating additional articles from the web","txt.single-page-crawl.loader.list_item.ai_agent_configuration":"Configuring your AI agent to use your knowledge base","txt.single-page-crawl.edit_sources_btn":"Edit sources","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.header":"Ask your AI agent questions","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.no_content_description":"Looks like your content needs to be added another way. You can copy and paste your trusted knowledge so your AI agent can answer common customer questions with ease.","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.description":"Now that it has some content, start asking questions. You can add more knowledge sources later, like your full website and tickets, to make it even smarter.","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.subtext":"AI agent is using info from these pages to answer questions.","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.placeholder":"https://yourcompany.com/faqs","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.changes_pending.zero":"{{pendingChanges}} changes pending","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.changes_pending.one":"{{pendingChanges}} change pending","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.changes_pending.two":"{{pendingChanges}} changes pending","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.changes_pending.few":"{{pendingChanges}} changes pending","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.changes_pending.many":"{{pendingChanges}} changes pending","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.changes_pending.other":"{{pendingChanges}} changes pending","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.invalid_url":"That isn't a valid URL, try another.","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.multiple_domains_error":"Enter URLs from the same site.","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.invalid_domain":"Only one domain is allowed.","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.duplicate_url":"Enter a unique URL.","txt.single-page-crawl.update_knowledge.server_error":"Couldn't find results at this URL, try another.","txt.single-page-crawl.expand_knowledge.header":"Expand your AI agent's knowledge","txt.single-page-crawl.expand_knowledge.description":"Here's more helpful info from the web to add to your AI agent's knowledge.","txt.single-page-crawl.expand_knowledge.text_area_label":"Company info","txt.single-page-crawl.expand_knowledge.text_area_description":"AI-generated content from web search.","txt.single-page-crawl.expand_knowledge.success_text":"We pulled info from other web sources for you. Review and then see it in action.","txt.single-page-crawl.expand_knowledge.deletion_success_text":"Generated content was removed. Your AI agent will still use your web content and you can add more anytime.","txt.single-page-crawl.expand_knowledge_manually.description":"Add more details to your agent's knowledge.","txt.single-page-crawl.expand_knowledge_manually.text_area_description":"Paste answers to at least 3 frequently asked questions. The more detail, the more specific your AI agent can be.","txt.single-page-crawl.copy_paste_page.input_label":"Paste answers to at least 3 frequently asked questions","txt.single-page-crawl.add_knowledge_page.header":"Edit knowledge sources","txt.single-page-crawl.add_knowledge_page.business_profile_label":"Business profile","txt.single-page-crawl.add_knowledge_page.business_profile_description":"Describe what your business does to help its replies. Factual descriptions work best.","txt.single-page-crawl.add_knowledge_page.business_profile_placeholder":"For example: We are a clothing company that designs and sells apparel. We also run textile recycling programs.","txt.single-page-crawl.add_knowledge_page.business_profile_character_limit":"{{charactersUsed}}/500 characters","txt.single-page-crawl.add_knowledge_page.business_profile_validation":"Enter in English to continue","txt.single-page-crawl.add_knowledge_page.knowledge_label":"Knowledge sources","txt.single-page-crawl.add_knowledge_page.website_subheader":"Your website content","txt.single-page-crawl.add_knowledge_page.generated_content.subheader":"Content from the web","txt.single-page-crawl.add_knowledge_page.generated_content.helper_text":"AI-generated content from web search","txt.single-page-crawl.external_content_type":"Website","txt.single-page-crawl.external_content_type_v2":"AI agent content","txt.single-page-crawl.external_content_crawler_name":"AI Agent Crawler","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome_page.ai_agent_example_chat.line_one":"You can connect to a number of sources: {{source_icons}}","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome_page.ai_agent_example_chat.line_two":"Let's start with your {{website_element}}.","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome_page.ai_agent_example_chat.website_element":"website","txt.single-page-crawl.welcome_page.ai_agent_example_chat.divider_text":"Add content to see it in action","txt.single-page-crawl.ai_agent_example_chat.placeholder_text":"Ask AI agent a question","txt.single-page-crawl.add_team_page.default_header":"Invite people to join the AI experience","txt.single-page-crawl.add_team_page.opt_out_header":"Invite team","txt.presumptive-preview.loader.list_item.views_and_ticket_fields":"Creating views and ticket fields related to your business","txt.presumptive-preview.loader.list_item.knowledge_ingestion":"Configuring your AI agent","txt.presumptive-preview.launch_modal.header":"Your trial is ready","txt.presumptive-preview.launch_modal.description":"We used info from {{url}} to get you started. You can make changes any time.","txt.presumptive-preview.launch_modal.description_fallback":"We used info from your website to get you started. You can make changes any time.","txt.presumptive-preview.launch_modal.ai_tab_item":"See your AI agent answer questions","txt.presumptive-preview.launch_modal.ai_panel_description":"Your AI agent uses your content on {{url}} to answer questions.","txt.presumptive-preview.launch_modal.ai_panel_description_fallback":"Your AI agent uses the content from your website to answer questions.","txt.presumptive-preview.launch_modal.views_tab_item":"Organize tickets with views","txt.presumptive-preview.launch_modal.views_panel_description":"Views help your agents keep organized and get through tickets faster.","txt.presumptive-preview.launch_modal.ticket_fields_tab_item":"Capture key info in ticket fields","txt.presumptive-preview.launch_modal.ticket_fields_panel_description":"Ticket fields help your team access the info they need for quicker resolutions and more customized service.","txt.presumptive-preview.launch_modal.footer_finish":"Explore your trial","txt.presumptive-preview.custom_ticket_field.tooltip":"AI-suggested ticket field for capturing {{ticket_field_name}}","employee_service.account_basics.welcome_modal.headline":"Welcome to your free trial","employee_service.account_basics.welcome_modal.body.line1":"Zendesk powers support for 55 million employees around the world. Now it's time to see why.","employee_service.account_basics.welcome_modal.body.line2":"First, a few steps to help you get started.","employee_service.account_basics.welcome_modal.primary_button":"Let's go","employee_service.account_basics.choose_department.eyebrow":"Step 1 of 3","employee_service.account_basics.choose_department.headline":"Pick your department to personalize your trial setup","employee_service.account_basics.choose_department.selection_it":"IT","employee_service.account_basics.choose_department.selection_error":"Select a department or skip to continue.","employee_service.account_basics.choose_department.selection_hr":"HR","employee_service.account_basics.choose_department.selection_other":"Other","employee_service.account_basics.choose_department.secondary_button":"Skip","employee_service.account_basics.choose_department.primary_button":"Next","employee_service.banner_nudge_connect_email.tag":"1 minute","employee_service.banner_nudge_connect_email.headline":"Connect your email","employee_service.banner_nudge_connect_email.body":"Convert email requests to tickets, send replies as emails, and see how Zendesk streamlines your service.","employee_service.banner_nudge_connect_email.secondary_button":"Maybe later","employee_service.banner_nudge_connect_email.primary_button":"Connect email","employee_service.banner_nudge_invite_team.tag":"Less than 1 minute","employee_service.banner_nudge_invite_team.headline":"Invite team members","employee_service.banner_nudge_invite_team.body":"Add up to 4 additional team members to your trial account.","employee_service.banner_nudge_invite_team.secondary_button":"Maybe later","employee_service.banner_nudge_invite_team.primary_button":"Invite team","employee_service.banner_nudge_solve_ticket.tag":"1 minute","employee_service.banner_nudge_solve_ticket.headline":"Solve your first ticket","employee_service.banner_nudge_solve_ticket.body":"Go from request to resolution in minutes.","employee_service.banner_nudge_solve_ticket.secondary_button":"Maybe later","employee_service.banner_nudge_solve_ticket.primary_button":"Solve ticket","employee_service.solve_ticket.sample_ticket.body_para_v1":"Hello, let's see how you or your agents can easily respond to and solve tickets.","employee_service.solve_ticket.sample_ticket.body_para_v2":"Feel free to email additional employee test inquiries to {{email}}.","employee_service.solve_ticket.sample_ticket.body_para_v3":"But first, let's start by solving one ticket.","employee_service.solve_ticket.sample_ticket.body_para_v4":"Your Zendesk Team","employee_service.solve_ticket.sample_ticket.subject":"Testing... How does Zendesk work?","employee_service.banner_nudge_connect_app.tag":"5 minutes","employee_service.banner_nudge_connect_app.headline":"Connect an app","employee_service.banner_nudge_connect_app.body":"Boost agent productivity and streamline workflows with app integrations.","employee_service.banner_nudge_connect_app.secondary_button":"Maybe later","employee_service.banner_nudge_connect_app.primary_button":"Connect app","employee_service.progress_tracker_default.eyebrow":"Setup guide","employee_service.progress_tracker_default.headline":"Account basics","employee_service.progress_tracker_default.connect_email":"Connect email","employee_service.progress_tracker_default.invite_team":"Invite team","employee_service.progress_tracker_default.solve_ticket":"Solve a ticket","employee_service.progress_tracker_default.connect_app":"Connect an app","employee_service.progress_tracker_default.button":"Start","employee_service.progress_tracker.continue_button":"Continue","employee_service.progress_tracker.view_button":"View","employee_service.setup_guide_entry.headline":"Set up more features","employee_service.setup_guide_entry.button":"View all setup guides","employee_service.setup_guide.left_panel_headline":"Setup guides","employee_service.setup_guide.help_entry":"Need setup help?","employee_service.setup_guide.help_body":"Watch a helpful video or get in touch with us.","employee_service.setup_guide.help_link_videos":"Get started videos","employee_service.setup_guide.help_link_message":"Send a message","employee_service.setup_guide.headline":"Let's get up and running","employee_service.setup_guide.body":"Build a connected service experience that boosts collaboration and speeds resolution.","employee_service.setup_guide.subheading":"Account basics","employee_service.setup_guide.sub_copy":"Connect your team and tools to deliver smarter service.","employee_service.setup_guide.connect_email":"Connect email","employee_service.setup_guide.invite_team":"Invite team","employee_service.setup_guide.solve_ticket":"Solve a ticket","employee_service.setup_guide.connect_app":"Connect an app","employee_service.setup_guide.default_button":"Start","employee_service.setup_guide.view_button":"View","employee_service.connect_email.it.eyebrow":"Step 2 of 3","employee_service.connect_email.it.tag":"1 minute","employee_service.connect_email.it.headline":"Connect your support email to see what Zendesk is really like","employee_service.connect_email.it.body":"This won't disrupt your existing systems or workflows. If you decide Zendesk isn't for you, your data will be securely deleted.","employee_service.connect_email.it.subheading":"Choose your support email provider","employee_service.connect_email.it.selection_gmail":"Gmail","employee_service.connect_email.it.checkbox_create_tickets":"Create tickets from last 300 emails","employee_service.connect_email.it.selection_microsoft_exchange":"Microsoft Exchange","employee_service.connect_email.it.tertiary_button":"Done","employee_service.connect_email.it.secondary_button":"Maybe later","employee_service.connect_email.it.primary_button":"Next","employee_service.connect_email.hr.eyebrow":"Step 2 of 3","employee_service.connect_email.hr.headline":"You're all set with a Zendesk email","employee_service.connect_email.hr.body.line1":"Share your new support email (support@{{companyName}}.zendesk.com). Every email automatically becomes a support ticket in Zendesk.","employee_service.connect_email.hr.body.line":"Share your new support email ({{zendesk_support_email}}). Every email automatically becomes a support ticket in Zendesk.","employee_service.connect_email.hr.body.line2":"If you decide to connect your own email later, you can do so anytime in Admin Center.","employee_service.connect_email.hr.tertiary_button":"Back","employee_service.connect_email.hr.primary_button":"Next","employee_service.connect_email.other.eyebrow":"Step 2 of 3","employee_service.connect_email.other.tag":"1 minute","employee_service.connect_email.other.headline":"Connect your support email to see what Zendesk is really like","employee_service.connect_email.other.body":"This won't disrupt your existing systems or workflows. If you decide Zendesk isn't for you, your data will be securely deleted.","employee_service.connect_email.other.subheading":"Choose your support email provider","employee_service.connect_email.other.selection_gmail":"Gmail","employee_service.connect_email.other.checkbox_create_tickets":"Create tickets from last 300 emails","employee_service.connect_email.other.selection_microsoft_exchange":"Microsoft Exchange","employee_service.connect_email.other.selection_zendesk_email":"Zendesk email","employee_service.connect_email.other.zendesk_email_description":"Start using your Zendesk email support@{{companyName}}.zendesk.com.","employee_service.connect_email.other.zendesk_email_description1":"Start using your Zendesk email {{zendesk_support_email}}.","employee_service.connect_email.other.tertiary_button":"Back","employee_service.connect_email.other.secondary_button":"Maybe later","employee_service.connect_email.other.primary_button":"Next","employee_service.connect_email.return.eyebrow":"Step 2 of 3","employee_service.connect_email.return.tag":"1 minute","employee_service.connect_email.return.headline":"Connect your support email to see what Zendesk is really like","employee_service.connect_email.return.body":"This won't disrupt your existing systems or workflows. If you decide Zendesk isn't for you, your data will be securely deleted.","employee_service.connect_email.return.subheading":"Choose your support email provider","employee_service.connect_email.return.selection_gmail":"Gmail","employee_service.connect_email.return.checkbox_create_tickets":"Create tickets from last 300 emails","employee_service.connect_email.return.selection_microsoft_exchange":"Microsoft Exchange","employee_service.connect_email.return.selection_email_forwarding":"Email forwarding","employee_service.connect_email.return.email_forwarding_description":"Incoming email from your external email account will be forwarded to Zendesk.","employee_service.connect_email.return.selection_zendesk_email":"Zendesk email","employee_service.connect_email.return.zendesk_email_description":"Start using your Zendesk email support@{{companyName}}.zendesk.com.","employee_service.connect_email.return.tertiary_button":"Done","employee_service.connect_email.return.secondary_button":"Maybe later","employee_service.connect_email.return.primary_button":"Next","employee_service.connect_email.success.headline":"Connected to {{emailAddress}}","employee_service.wizard_flow.modal.close":"Close","employee_service.connect_email.email_success.headline":"Nice! You're on your way.","employee_service.connect_email.email_success.body.line1":"Your tickets will show up in Zendesk in about 2 minutes.","employee_service.connect_email.email_success.body.line2":"Next, invite your team to check out your Zendesk trial.","employee_service.connect_email.email_success.primary_button":"Next","employee_service.connect_email.email_success.return_to_agent_home.primary_button":"Done","employee_service.connect_email.email_success.make-changes":"You can make changes anytime in the {{#emailLink}}Admin Center{{/emailLink}}.","employee_service.invite_team.eyebrow":"Step 3 of 3","employee_service.invite_team.headline":"Add your team","employee_service.invite_team.body":"They'll get an email invitation to join your Zendesk account.","employee_service.invite_team.label_email":"Email address","employee_service.invite_team.label_role":"Role","employee_service.invite_team.button_add_another":"+ Add another","employee_service.invite_team.secondary_button":"Maybe later","employee_service.invite_team.primary_button":"Send invite","employee_service.invite_team.role_tooltip.headline":"What's the difference?","employee_service.invite_team.role_tooltip.body.line1":"Admins have full access to set up and manage accounts.","employee_service.invite_team.role_tooltip.body.line2":"Agents solve tickets but have limited access to settings and permissions.","employee_service.invite_team.invite_success.headline":"Everything's coming together","employee_service.invite_team.invite_success.body":"Now it's time to solve your first ticket.","employee_service.invite_team.invite_success1.body":"Now that you have those basics, it's time to solve your first ticket.","employee_service.invite_team.invite_success.secondary_button":"Maybe later","employee_service.invite_team.invite_success.primary_button":"Solve a test ticket","employee_service.ticketing_basics.tooltip_1.headline":"Write a reply","employee_service.ticketing_basics.tooltip_1.body":"Enter a reply to answer requests and questions.","employee_service.ticketing_basics.tooltip_2.headline":"Submit the ticket as solved","employee_service.ticketing_basics.tooltip_2.body":"Send your reply, and you're done.","employee_service.apply_your_new_macro.header":"Quickly respond to your employee's inquiry","employee_service.ticketing_basics.ticket_success.headline":"You solved your first ticket!","employee_service.ticketing_basics.ticket_success.body":"Now, let's connect an app to bring all your tools together","employee_service.ticketing_basics.ticket_success.secondary_button":"Maybe later","employee_service.ticketing_basics.ticket_success.primary_button":"Next","employee_service.integrations.tooltip.headline":"Agents can access installed apps here","employee_service.integrations.tooltip.body":"Connect an app to surface all the information your agents need.","employee_service.integrations.tooltip.button":"Select app","employee_service.integrations.edit_connection":"Edit connection","employee_service.integrations.connected":"Connected","employee_service.integrations.it.headline":"Connect your apps to Zendesk","employee_service.integrations.it.body":"Provide faster service and share key info across departments. For more apps and integrations, visit Zendesk App Marketplace.","employee_service.integrations.ms_teams.body":"Create and update support tickets from Microsoft Teams channels.","employee_service.integrations.ms_teams.link":"Connect Microsoft Teams","employee_service.integrations.slack.body":"Create and take action on support tickets from Slack channels.","employee_service.integrations.slack.link":"Connect Slack","employee_service.integrations.jira.body":"Link, view, and escalate Jira issues from a ticket in Zendesk.","employee_service.integrations.jira.link":"Connect Jira","employee_service.integrations.pagerduty.body":"Notify your team and escalate critical issues from Zendesk.","employee_service.integrations.pagerduty.link":"Connect PagerDuty","employee_service.integrations.hr.headline":"Connect an app to Zendesk","employee_service.integrations.hr.body":"Provide faster service and share key info across departments. For more apps and integrations, visit Zendesk App Marketplace.","employee_service.integrations.workday.body":"View employee details in Zendesk and set permissions based on Workday roles.","employee_service.integrations.workday.link":"Connect Workday","employee_service.integrations.hibob.body":"Update records and add notes without leaving Zendesk.","employee_service.integrations.hibob.link":"Connect HiBob","employee_service.integrations.rippling.body":"Manage user accounts and sync employee data from Zendesk.","employee_service.integrations.rippling.link":"Connect Rippling","employee_service.integrations.bamboohr.body":"View employee details in Zendesk tickets.","employee_service.integrations.bamboohr.link":"Connect BambooHR","employee_service.integrations.other.headline":"Connect an app to Zendesk","employee_service.integrations.other.body":"Provide faster service and share key info across departments. For more apps and integrations, visit Zendesk App Marketplace.","txt.employee_service_trial.flexible_trial.first_step.subheader_top_v2":"Get started with best-in-class employee service","txt.employee_service_trial.flexible_trial.first_step.subheader_bottom_v2":"More ways to help your employees","txt.employee_service_trial.task.first_steps.card.start_chat.description":"Help employees the moment they need it on your website, mobile apps, and social channels.","txt.employee_service_trial.task.first_steps.card.check_help_center.name":"Help employees help themselves","txt.employee_service_trial.task.first_steps.card.check_help_center.description":"Assist employees even when no one's in the office. Your help center is set up with sample content that you can edit, customize, and launch.","txt.employee_service_trial.first_steps.card.check_knowledge.cta.text":"Check out your knowledge","txt.employee_service_trial.spp.team_section.add_members_task.agent_item":"{{agents_role}} are assigned tickets, interact with employees, and resolve support issues.","txt.employee_service_trial.manage_tickets.description_v2":"Zendesk turns all employee conversations into tickets. Whether customers chat, call, email, or connect on social media, tickets from all channels are in one place.","txt.employee_service_trial.manage_tickets.description_v3":"Zendesk turns all employee conversations into tickets. Whether employees chat, call, email, or connect on social media, tickets from all channels are in one place.","txt.employee_service_trial.hotspots.learn_about_ticket.content":"The ticketing system shows all your employee information and history in a single screen. Agents can respond quicker and provide more personalized support since everything they need is in one place.","txt.employee_service_trial.hotspots.learn_about_ticket.description":"Agent Workspace organizes each employee's conversations into a single view along with their interaction history and profile details. Agents can help employees on chat, messaging, email and voice from a single support ticket.","txt.employee_service_trial.agent_productivity.use_macros.paragraph_v2":"Macros help agents respond to tickets faster. The most popular macros are prepared responses to common employee questions, saving agents time from repetitively writing the same thing over and over. Additionally, macros can modify tickets.","txt.employee_service_trial.agent_productivity.automate_actions.mainDescription":"Triggers help you save time and effort by automating repeat tasks. Popular triggers include notifying employees when their ticket is updated or routing requests to a specialized agent group. Additionally, triggers can modify tickets.","txt.employee_service_trial.agent_productivity.automate_actions.subtask_one.text":"Let your employees know you got their message. This acknowledgement helps build trust. You can use the default request received email notification or revise it to better sound like your brand.","txt.employee_service_trial.agent_productivity.automate_actions.subtask_two.text_two":"To get this notification intended for employees, you'll need a different email than the one you used to sign in.","txt.employee_service_trial.agent_productivity.automate_actions.subtask_two.subhead":"See what your employees see","txt.employee_service_trial.agent_productivity.automate_actions.list_one":"Sending employee surveys or route priority employees","txt.employee_service_trial.add_messaging_to_employee_portal_task.header":"Add Zendesk to your Employee Portal","txt.employee_service_trial.messaging_as_default.social_messaging_task.paragraph":"Real-time and ongoing employee conversations are seamless when you add Zendesk to your Employee Portal. After setup, further customize Web Widget to suit your needs. ","txt.employee_service_trial.preview_update.employee_text":"I need a new laptop","txt.employee_service_trial.preview_update.bot_article_title":"Requesting New Hardware","txt.employee_service_trial.framework.hc_intro_task":"Help employees help themselves","txt.employee_service_trial.framework.knowledge_theme":"Knowledge","txt.employee_service_trial.sd_in_hc.cta.checkout_your_help_center":"Check out your knowledge","txt.employee_service_trial.help_center.task_one.paragraph_1_v2":"Employees prefer to get answers themselves. This means you'll have fewer tickets and agents will have more time to focus on complex employee needs.","txt.employee_service_trial.help_center.task_one.statistic_1":"of employees attempt to solve their own problem first","txt.employee_service_trial.help_center.task_one.statistic_3":"time-savings for agents when employees use a help center","txt.employee_service_trial.help_center.task_one.statistic_3_v2":"time-savings for agents when employees use knowledge","txt.employee_service_trial.help_center.task_two.paragraph_1":"A help center makes it easy for employees to find important content.","txt.employee_service_trial.help_center.task_two.paragraph_2_v2":"Companies have the freedom to organize content the way they see fit so it's easier for employees to find the right stuff.","txt.employee_service_trial.help_center.task_three.paragraph_1_v3":"After publishing, you can edit and update content at any time to ensure it continues meeting employee needs.","txt.employee_service_trial.framework.reveal_opportunities_through_data_task.list.list_item_one":"Access key employee insights","txt.employee_service_trial.framework.reveal_opportunities_through_data_task.statistic_2":"reduction in employee wait time","txt.employee_service_trial.framework.reveal_opportunities_through_data_task.statistic_3":"volume of employee requests solved","txt.employee_service_trial.framework.visualize_your_data_task.description":"Customizable, built-in dashboards and charts make it easy to manage team staffing and performance, plus gain understanding of employee interactions. You can look at real-time and historical trends across all channels to enhance the overall employee experience.","txt.employee_service_trial.apps_and_int_theme.task_one.paragraph":"The Zendesk Marketplace is a one-stop-shop to make all types of integrations seamless. You're able to create a unified employee experience that fits your business.","txt.employee_service_trial.apps_and_int_theme.task_one.list_item_one":"Get apps for everything from HRIS integrations to ticket management","txt.employee_service_trial.apps_and_int_theme.task_two.sub_header":"Connect everything within a few clicks. Find partners, apps, and integrations that help drive employee satisfaction, increase agent productivity, and streamline workflows.","txt.employee_service_trial.framework.lern_more.list_item_text_two":"Others have forged the path for you, so learn how they implemented and used Zendesk to better serve their employees. {{#link}}Read customer stories{{/link}}","txt.employee_service_trial.framework.lern_more.find_the_complete_subhead":"Find the complete employee service solution that fits your company.","txt.employee_service_trial.framework.lern_more.banner_text":"Zendesk Suite is a complete employee service solution that has a variety of plans to fit companies of all sizes in any stage of business.","txt.employee_service_trial.agent_productivity.use_macros.tooltip_two.text":"Select the appropriate macro to either respond to the requester's inquiry or choose an action that amends the ticket.","txt.employee_service_trial.agent_productivity.use_filters.tooltip_two.text":"Views are organized to always include the ticket's subject, the requester's name, and time of their request. The other fields change per view to better provide context.","txt.employee_service_trial.hotspots.point_to_views.tooltip.content":"Views is your inbox where you can set up filters to group tickets, such as VIP Employees or Laptop Requests.","txt.employee_service_trial.hotspots.point_to_apps.tooltip.content":"Access employee and business data from native and third-party apps without ever leaving ticketing.","txt.employee_service_trial.hotspots.point_to_panel.tooltip.header":"Employees don't have to repeat themselves","txt.employee_service_trial.hotspots.point_to_ticket_statuses.tooltip.content":"Before leaving a ticket, make sure to submit a status as {{open}}, {{pending}}, or {{solved}}. This keeps both agents and employees clear on the ticket's progress.","txt.employee_service_trial.onboarding_set_up.tooltip.agent_tour.first.context":"Here's what unified employee conversations look like. Whether it's email, chat, voice, or social channels, it's all front and center, so agents have better context.","txt.employee_service_trial.onboarding_set_up.tooltip.agent_tour.second.title":"Choose the right channel for your employee","txt.employee_service_trial.onboarding_set_up.tooltip.agent_tour.second.context":"Agents select the best way for responding on the employee's preferred channel. Plus leave internal notes for your team members.","txt.employee_service_trial.onboarding_set_up.tooltip.agent_tour.third.title":"Quick employee profile","txt.employee_service_trial.onboarding_set_up.tooltip.agent_tour.third.context":"The essentials card shows an employee's contact information and preferred language. Plus add external profiles so you can integrate all the employee's information.","txt.employee_service_trial.onboarding_set_up.tooltip.agent_tour.fourth.context":"The interaction history gives visibility into previous conversations and events, including from external systems, so employees don't have to repeat themselves.","employee_service.knowledge.admin.banner.headline":"Publish a help article","employee_service.knowledge.admin.banner.tag":"5 minutes","employee_service.knowledge.admin.banner.body":"Empower your help center for faster service and AI assistance","employee_service.knowledge.admin.banner.secondary_button":"Maybe later","employee_service.knowledge.admin.banner.primary_button":"Start","employee_service.knowledge.admin.progress_tracker.eyebrow":"Setup guide","employee_service.knowledge.admin.progress_tracker.self_service.title":"Self-service","employee_service.knowledge.admin.progress_tracker.self_service.body":"Build a knowledge base for faster support and AI suggestions.","employee_service.knowledge.admin.progress_tracker.item1":"Publish help article","employee_service.knowledge.admin.progress_tracker.item2":"Activate help center","employee_service.knowledge.admin.progress_tracker.primary_button":"Start","employee_service.knowledge.admin.setup_guide.done_button":"View","employee_service.knowledge.admin.setup_guide.subheading":"Get the most out of your plan from day one.","employee_service.knowledge.admin.setup_guide.card.title":"View more setup guides","employee_service.knowledge.admin.setup_guide.card.link":"Go to launchpad","employee_service.knowledge.admin.self_service_introduction_modal.headline":"Empower your team with 24/7 self-service","employee_service.knowledge.admin.self_service_introduction_modal.body":"Publish your first help article to provide instant answers and reduce your ticket volume.","employee_service.knowledge.admin.self_service_introduction_modal.primary_button":"Let's go","employee_service.knowledge.admin.knowledge_success_modal.headline":"Publish your article","employee_service.knowledge.admin.knowledge_success_modal.body":"When you're ready, toggle the dropdown to publish the article.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.tooltip1.headline":"Activate a task list","employee_service.workflows.tasks.tooltip1.body":"Activate a sample task list to add it to a ticket.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.tooltip2.headline":"Add a task list","employee_service.workflows.tasks.tooltip2.body":"Agents can find activated task lists and add them to a ticket","employee_service.workflows.tasks.tooltip3.headline":"Complete a task","employee_service.workflows.tasks.tooltip3.body":"Mark task as complete to cross it off the list.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.emptyState.headline":"No task list yet","employee_service.workflows.tasks.emptyState.description":"Activate a task list or create a new one.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.buttons.preview":"Preview","employee_service.workflows.tasks.buttons.activate":"Activate","employee_service.workflows.tasks.buttons.addTaskList":"Add task list","employee_service.workflows.tasks.suggestedListsModal.tag":"Task list preview","employee_service.workflows.tasks.suggestedListsModal.headline":"Keep every project on track","employee_service.workflows.tasks.suggestedListsModal.description":"Start with suggested task lists to help your agents follow the right steps.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.buttons.cancel":"Cancel","employee_service.workflows.tasks.buttons.createYourOwn":"Create your own","employee_service.workflows.tasks.buttons.next":"Next","employee_service.workflows.tasks.editingModal.save":"Save","employee_service.workflows.tasks.editingModal.activated":"Activated","employee_service.workflows.tasks.editingModal.addAnotherTask":"+ Add another task","employee_service.workflows.tasks.editingModal.makeMoreEdits":"Make more edits in {{adminCenter}}","employee_service.workflows.tasks.successMessage.headline":"Task list added","employee_service.workflows.tasks.successModal.headline":"Tasks are ready to go 🎉","employee_service.workflows.tasks.successModal.body":"Now your team can track work and stay organized.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.successModal.doneButton":"Done","employee_service.workflows.tasks.successModal.hintText":"You can edit tasks anytime in the {{adminCenter}}.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.name":"Employee onboarding","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.description":"4 tasks • Set up new team members with equipment and account access.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.descriptionWithoutCount":"Set up new team members with equipment and account access.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.task1.title":"Confirm signed contract","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.task1.description":"Verify that the new employee has signed and returned all required documents.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.task2.title":"Initiate background check","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.task2.description":"Submit the request to verify employment eligibility. Select the appropriate verification package for the role.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.task3.title":"ID and badge setup","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.task3.description":"Coordinate the creation of the team member's ID card, security badge, and office access.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.task4.title":"Schedule orientation","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.task4.description":"Coordinate a 30-minute sync with IT, HR, and Facilities. Include calendar invites and prep materials.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.name":"Employee offboarding","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.hr.description":"4 tasks • Manage equipment returns and final payroll.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.hr.task1.title":"Confirm resignation date","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.hr.task1.description":"Verify the last day of employment.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.hr.task2.title":"Review final payroll and benefits summary","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.hr.task2.description":"Calculate final pay and update the status of all active benefit plans.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.hr.task3.title":"Schedule exit interview","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.hr.task3.description":"Set up a meeting to gather feedback on the employee's experience and reason for leaving.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.hr.task4.title":"Notify IT to process equipment return","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.hr.task4.description":"Alert the IT team to coordinate the collection and return of company-issued hardware.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.name":"Equipment request","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.description":"Approve, configure, and ship hardware for team members.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.descriptionWithCount":"4 tasks • Approve, configure, and ship hardware for team members.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.hr.task1.title":"Review request and justification","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.hr.task1.description":"Verify the request meets company policy.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.hr.task2.title":"Verify budget approval","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.hr.task2.description":"Confirm that the department has enough funds available for the purchase.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.hr.task3.title":"Notify IT to fulfill request","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.hr.task3.description":"Alert the IT team that the equipment is approved and ready for setup.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.hr.task4.title":"Update asset inventory","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.hr.task4.description":"Record the new equipment in the tracking system once the purchase is confirmed.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.leaveRequest.name":"Leave of absence","employee_service.workflows.tasks.leaveRequest.description":"4 tasks • Track leave request and coordinate team coverage.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.leaveRequest.task1.title":"Verify medical or legal docs","employee_service.workflows.tasks.leaveRequest.task1.description":"Review any supporting documentation required to approve the leave request.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.leaveRequest.task2.title":"Coordinate coverage with manager","employee_service.workflows.tasks.leaveRequest.task2.description":"Ensure the employee's team has a plan to manage their workload during the absence.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.leaveRequest.task3.title":"Manage system access","employee_service.workflows.tasks.leaveRequest.task3.description":"Adjust or pause account permissions during the absence based on company policy.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.leaveRequest.task4.title":"Send return-to-work instructions","employee_service.workflows.tasks.leaveRequest.task4.description":"Provide clear steps for the employee to rejoin the team when their leave ends.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.it.task1.title":"Create email account","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.it.task1.description":"Set up a new company email address and grant access to the workspace.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.it.task2.title":"Send login credentials","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.it.task2.description":"Securely share usernames and temporary passwords with the new hire.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.it.task3.title":"Set up laptop and hardware","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.it.task3.description":"Install necessary software on the device and prepare it for use.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.it.task4.title":"Grant access to internal tools","employee_service.workflows.tasks.onboarding.it.task4.description":"Grant the appropriate license and permissions based on the employee's team.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.it.description":"4 tasks • Manage access removal and equipment returns.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.it.descriptionWithoutCount":"Manage equipment returns and final payroll.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.it.task1.title":"Revoke system access and credentials","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.it.task1.description":"Deactivate accounts for internal tools to protect company data and security.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.it.task2.title":"Reclaim laptop and hardware","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.it.task2.description":"Coordinate the return of company-owned devices and accessories.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.it.task3.title":"Deactivate user","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.it.task3.description":"Remove the agent's license so it can be reassigned to a new team member.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.it.task4.title":"Archive user data","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.it.task4.description":"Back up important files or communications before permanently deleting the account.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.it.task1.title":"Select equipment from inventory","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.it.task1.description":"Pick the requested item from current stock or order it from a vendor.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.it.task2.title":"Configure device for new user","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.it.task2.description":"Install the required software, security settings, and user profiles.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.other.task2.description":"Prepare the hardware with the necessary profiles, software, and security protocols.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.it.task3.title":"Ship to employee address","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.it.task3.description":"Package and send the equipment to the employee's preferred location.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.it.task4.title":"Confirm receipt of equipment","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.it.task4.description":"Follow up to ensure the employee received the item and it is working correctly.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.other.task1.title":"Process final payroll and benefits","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.other.task1.description":"Verify the last day of work and calculate the final pay cycle and benefit status.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.other.task2.title":"Revoke system access","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.other.task2.description":"Deactivate email and internal tool accounts to protect company data.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.other.task3.title":"Reclaim laptop and equipment","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.other.task3.description":"Coordinate the return of all company-issued hardware and accessories.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.other.task4.title":"Update personnel records","employee_service.workflows.tasks.offboarding.other.task4.description":"Mark the employee as inactive in the database and archive their user data.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.other.task1.title":"Review request and budget","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.other.task1.description":"Check the item's necessity and ensure department funds are available for the purchase.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.other.task3.title":"Ship equipment to employee","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.other.task3.description":"Package and send the items to the employee's verified shipping location.","employee_service.workflows.tasks.equipmentRequest.other.task4.title":"Update inventory","employee_service.workflows.approvals.tooltip.headline":"Request approval","employee_service.workflows.approvals.tooltip.body":"The approval status updates automatically when the approver responds.","employee_service.workflows.approvals.introductionModal.tag":"Admins and agents","employee_service.workflows.approvals.introductionModal.headline":"Give approval in Zendesk","employee_service.workflows.approvals.introductionModal.body":"Get faster answers and keep your projects moving. Your team can review and respond to requests right from their workspace.","employee_service.workflows.approvals.cancelButton":"Cancel","employee_service.workflows.approvals.nextButton":"Next","employee_service.workflows.approvals.collaboratorsModal.tag":"Collaborators","employee_service.workflows.approvals.collaboratorsModal.headline":"Get decisions from anyone","employee_service.workflows.approvals.collaboratorsModal.body":"Approver doesn't have access to Zendesk? They'll receive an email to review and approve your request.","employee_service.workflows.approvals.successModal.headline":"You're request ready 🎉","employee_service.workflows.approvals.successModal.body":"Keep track of every approval, decline, and comment in one place. Add your team to start collaborating.","employee_service.workflows.approvals.successModal.addTeamMemberButton":"Add team member","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.approver.preview.zoom-in-button":"Zoom in","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.approver.preview.zoom-out-button":"Zoom out","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.approver.name":"[SAMPLE] Approver","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.hr.subject":"Extended leave request: Employee #65120","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.hr.description":"We need manager approval to grant leave of absence for 2 weeks or longer.","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.it.subject":"Zendesk access request for Employee #65120","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.it.description":"Your newest team member requested access to Zendesk Support. We need manager approval to give them a seat.","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.other.subject":"Financial approval for furniture replacement","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.other.description":"Leadership requested new, ergonomic chairs. It exceeds the standard equipment budget, so we need your approval.","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContentNew.hr.subject":"Extended leave request","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContentNew.hr.description":"Review and approve this leave request.","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContentNew.it.subject":"Equipment request","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContentNew.it.description":"Review and approve this equipment request.","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContentNew.other.subject":"Approval for purchase request","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContentNew.other.description":"Review and approve this purchase request.","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.heading":"Approval request received:","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.sent_by.label":"Sent by","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.id.label":"ID","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.id.value":"#1","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.priority.label":"Priority","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.priority.value":"Normal","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.reviewRequest":"Review request","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.comment.heading":"Comments","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.comment.description":"Add notes or ask for additional information","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.approve_request.button":"Approve request","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.deny_request.button":"Deny request","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.status.label":"Status","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.status.value":"Decision pending","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.sent_by.value":"{{trial.user}}","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.sent_on.label":"Sent on","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.sent_on.value":"{{date}}","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.preview.approver.label":"Approver","employee_service.workflows.approvals.sampleContent.success.approver.footer.link":"Dive deeper into approvals anytime in the {{#emailLink}}Admin Center{{/emailLink}}.","txt.composer.ineligible_agent.alert.close_button":"Close alert","txt.composer.one_ineligible_agent.alert":"{{invitedAgent}} can't send public replies to this conversation","txt.composer.two_ineligible_agents.alert":"{{firstInvitedAgent}} and {{secondInvitedAgent}} can't send public replies to this conversation","txt.composer.three_ineligible_agents.alert":"{{firstInvitedAgent}}, {{secondInvitedAgent}} and 1 other can't send public replies to this conversation","txt.composer.restricted_agent.alert.user_is_restricted_message":"{{userNameOrEmail}} can't be CC'd due to permissions.","txt.composer.many_ineligible_agents.alert":"{{firstInvitedAgent}}, {{secondInvitedAgent}} and {{invitedAgentsCount}} others can't send public replies to this conversation","txt.composer.restricted_agent.alert.add_follower_button":"Add as a follower","txt.composer.restricted_agent.alert.close_button":"Close alert","txt.omnichannel.composer.take_it_to_join_a_live_conversation":"Take this ticket to join the conversation.","txt.omnichannel.composer.take_it_to_join_a_live_conversation_v2":"Take this ticket to join the conversation. {{link}}","txt.omnichannel.composer.take_it_to_join_a_live_conversation_v2_link_text":"Assign to me","txt.agent_invitations.onboarding.composer.collaborate_in_conversation.body":"You can send public replies and get notified when there are updates","txt.agent_invitations.onboarding.composer.collaborate_in_conversation.title":"Start collaborating in this conversation","txt.agent_invitations.onboarding.composer.get_help_via_at_mentions.body":"@mention others in internal notes to collaborate with them in messaging conversations","txt.agent_invitations.onboarding.composer.get_help_via_at_mentions.title":"Get help from teammates","txt.agent_invitations.onboarding.stop_following_conversation.body":"When you’re done collaborating, remove yourself as a follower to stop receiving updates","txt.agent_invitations.onboarding.stop_following_conversation.title":"Leave conversation anytime","txt.agent_invitations.onboarding.track_at_mentions.body":"New messages from the conversations you follow will appear in the messaging updates list","txt.agent_invitations.onboarding.track_at_mentions.body_v1":"Conversations you're mentioned in will appear in the messaging updates list","txt.agent_invitations.onboarding.track_at_mentions.title":"Keep track of your mentions","txt.agent_invitations.onboarding.dismiss_icon.aria_label":"Close","txt.support.agent_as_a_requester.no_access_redirect.header":"You can't access the request here","txt.support.agent_as_a_requester.no_access_redirect.header_v2":"You can't access the request here","txt.support.agent_as_a_requester.no_access_redirect.message_body":"You assigned it to {{assignee}}, a private group you don't belong to. As the requester, you can view by going to {{redirectLocation}}.","txt.support.agent_as_a_requester.no_access_redirect.message_body_v2":"You assigned it to {{assignee}}, a group you don't belong to and don't have access to. As the requester, you can view by going to {{redirectLocation}}.","txt.support.agent_as_a_requester.no_access_redirect.cta":"Open request in {{redirectLocation}}","txt.support.agent_as_a_requester.no_access_redirect.cta_v2":"Open request in {{redirectLocation}}","txt.support.agent_as_a_requester.no_access_redirect.redirect_location_guide":"Guide","txt.ctp.notice.banner.pre":"{{#title}}Chat maintenance coming soon{{/title}}It will 