ty_insights.field.escalation_request.detected":"Detected","quality_insights.field.escalation_request.not_detected":"Not detected","quality_insights.field.agent_tone.rating_1":"Tone was dismissive, rude, or unprofessional.","quality_insights.field.agent_tone.rating_2":"Tone was cold, curt, or lacking effort.","quality_insights.field.agent_tone.rating_3":"Tone was professional but unremarkable.","quality_insights.field.agent_tone.rating_4":"Tone was friendly, polite, and helpful throughout the interaction.","quality_insights.field.agent_tone.rating_5":"Tone was outstanding, empathetic, and personalized.","quality_insights.field.solution_offered.rating_1":"No resolution or clear path forward was provided to the customer.","quality_insights.field.solution_offered.rating_2":"A solution was proposed, but it didn't address all core issues or was missing key steps.","quality_insights.field.solution_offered.rating_3":"A comprehensive resolution or a clear, documented next step was provided.","quality_insights.field.customer_tone.rating_1":"Expressing extreme anger, insults, or severe dissatisfaction.","quality_insights.field.customer_tone.rating_2":"Noticeably frustrated, annoyed, or disappointed with the situation.","quality_insights.field.customer_tone.rating_3":"Communication was calm, matter-of-fact, or indifferent.","quality_insights.field.customer_tone.rating_4":"Customer was cooperative, polite, and generally satisfied.","quality_insights.field.customer_tone.rating_5":"Expressing delight, high praise, or deep gratitude for the service.","quality_insights.field.empathy.detected_description":"The agent used active listening and verbal cues to show understanding of the customer's situation.","quality_insights.field.empathy.not_detected_description":"The agent failed to acknowledge the customer's emotional state or validate their concerns.","quality_insights.field.churn_risk.detected_description":"Customer explicitly mentioned canceling, quitting, or switching to a competitor.","quality_insights.field.churn_risk.not_detected_description":"No language indicating an intent to leave the service was identified.","quality_insights.field.escalation_request.detected_description":"Customer requested to speak with a manager, supervisor, or higher-level support.","quality_insights.field.escalation_request.not_detected_description":"No explicit request for hierarchy escalation was made.","quality_insights.field.empathy.category_description":"Measures if the agent acknowledged the customer's perspective or validated their emotions.","quality_insights.field.agent_tone.category_description":"Evaluates the agent's delivery, ranging from abrupt and cold to warm and engaging.","quality_insights.field.solution_offered.category_description":"Evaluates if the agent provided a conclusive outcome or a substantive next step.","quality_insights.field.customer_tone.category_description":"Tracks the customer's delivery, identifying levels of frustration, neutrality, or delight.","quality_insights.field.churn_risk.category_description":'Scans for "flight risk" language, such as intent to cancel or mentions of competitors.',"quality_insights.field.escalation_request.category_description":"Detects explicit requests to speak with a supervisor or move the ticket to a higher tier.","txt.agent_dashboard.channel.aria_label":"{{currentChannel}}: Selected channel","txt.asset_management.usage_warning.blocked.title":"Asset limit reached","txt.asset_management.usage_warning.blocked.body":"Add more assets to increase your limit or delete an asset record to add a new one.","txt.asset_management.usage_warning.approaching.title":"You've used {{percent}}% of your assets","txt.asset_management.usage_warning.approaching.body":"Add more assets to increase your limit.","txt.asset_management.usage_warning.close_button":"Dismiss warning","txt.pause_banner.title":"Your account is scheduled to be paused","txt.pause_banner.description_owner":"Your account will be paused on {{pauseStar